# The factory's gates for {{name}}: hapi-factory's reusable gates workflow, on
# every pull request and every push to main. Its check is `ci / gates` (this
# job, `ci`, calling the workflow's job `gates`), which main-protect requires.
#
# The SHA below is the gates' only pin (hapi-factory design §6a item 6):
# Actions' SHA-pinning policy and workflow lockfiles don't cover a reusable
# workflow's call. It names a hapi-factory commit; bump it by PR.
name: hapi-gates

on:
  pull_request: {}
  push:
    branches: [main]

permissions: {}

jobs:
  ci:
    permissions:
      contents: read
    uses: {{owner}}/hapi-factory/.github/workflows/gates.yml@{{gates_sha}}
